The quark mass in Table~\ref{table_parameters} is such that the decay width of pion into a couple of photons $\Gamma(\pi\to\gamma\gamma)\approx 7.7$ eV~\cite{ParticleDataGroup:2024cfk}, where the amplitude is found from the diagram in Fig.~\ref{figure_pgg}
