	\includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{troditional-vs-data-agent.pdf}
	\caption{\label{troditional_vs_data_agent} Traditional paradigm of data analysis with tools and new paradigm brought by generative AI. On the left, traditional data analysis tools include MySQL database, Excel, Python, SPSS and R. On the right, data analysis is conducted through natural language interactions with ChatGPT, enabling intuitive, conversational queries and automated data insights, streamlining the analytical process without requiring extensive technical input \citep{gu2024analysts}.}
