The contributions of our proposed work are listed below: 

\begin{itemize}
    \item We integrate multi-source data for robust gene representations by combining pre-trained embeddings from multiple sourced Gene Regulatory Networks (GRNs), gene expression data, and gene interaction networks, creating enriched and robust gene representations. 

